    * pkgA bumped from 1.1.1 to 1.1.2",
            "version": Version {
              "build": undefined,
              "major": 2,
              "minor": 2,
              "patch": 3,
              "preRelease": undefined,
            },
          },
          {
            "component": "pkgC",
            "notes": "### Dependencies

* The following workspace dependencies were updated
  * dependencies
    * pkgB bumped from 2.2.2 to 2.2.3",
            "version": Version {
              "build": undefined,
              "major": 3,
              "minor": 3,
              "patch": 4,
              "preRelease": undefined,
            },
          },
          {
            "component": "pkgE",
            "notes": "### Dependencies

* The following workspace dependencies were updated
  * dependencies
    * pkgA bumped from 1.1.1 to 1.1.2",
            "version": Version {
              "build": undefined,
              "major": 3,
              "minor": 3,
              "patch": 4,
              "preRelease": undefined,
            },
